      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">عَمَقَةٌ</span></b>  <i>Feculence</i> (<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">وَضَرٌ</span>) <i>of clarified butter,</i> [<i>adhering to the interior</i>] <i>in a skin:</i> (Lh, O, K:)
